# logo-mark.png — immutable for automation

`Docs/branding/assets/logo-mark.png` is the **canonical logo** (human-provided raster).

## Forbidden (agents and scripts)

- Writing, overwriting, or “fixing” `logo-mark.png`
- Reinterpreting the logo as hand-drawn SVG paths (use `export-logo-mark-svg.py` for a conformant raster embed only)

## Allowed

- **Read** for compositing (e.g. landing hero script) or display (`AllAboardLogoMark` imports PNG via symlink)
- **Human-only** replacement of `logo-mark.png`
- **Regenerate** `logo-mark.svg` via `scripts/branding/export-logo-mark-svg.py` (read-only on PNG)

## UI

`AllAboardLogoMark` uses **logo-mark.svg** (transparent embed from PNG; `packages/ui/src/assets/logo-mark.svg` → Docs).
